# Screenshot sweeps are for looking at, not for keeping.
#
# One pattern, because the last two attempts at this added one line per
# target and the next target invented a new directory name: .sweep-output
# was ignored, .axes-output was not, and CI failed on a committed
# .last-run.json. Every visual target writes to tooling/visual/.out now,
# and the runs themselves go to a scratch directory outside the repo.
tooling/visual/.out/
tooling/fixtures/consumers/.out/
.sweep-output/
.axes-output/
.visual-sweep/
.visual-axes/
apps/site/.out/
